                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='25841' id='19' type-v2='text' w='62579' x='36741' y='72965'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Weekly Business Finance Commentary</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Gross transaction value declined 6.7% week-over-week to INR 1,799,937, led by the Marketplace segment (effective take rate 2.05%). The movement doesn&apos;t have a confirmed root cause in this dataset and is worth investigating against marketing spend, merchant churn, or seasonality before it&apos;s flagged upward. The failed-transaction rate sits at 7.19% (down 6.0% WoW), within normal range but worth a spot-check if it continues trending up. Refund payouts came in at INR 42,766 (down 49.8% WoW). Separately, this run&apos;s data-quality checks flagged 464 high-severity records (missing settlements, settlement mismatches, duplicate transactions, and orphan refunds), recommend the data team triage these before this snapshot is treated as final for reporting.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
